{"id": 10, "ts": 1780465052.1839392, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I agree with Emily that Candidate\u202fB remains the strongest overall, but I want to highlight the gaps in Candidate\u202fA\u2019s profile that keep me from shifting my vote. Sarah confirmed that A \u201chas very good leadership qualities,\u201d yet we have no concrete evidence of operational reliability (dependability, consistency) or of how A works with crew members. Moreover, my own notes describe A as a \u201cshow\u2011off\u201d and \u201cnot open to new ideas,\u201d traits that can undermine crew cooperation and adaptability\u2014critical for long\u2011haul flights. In contrast, Candidate\u202fB\u2019s record shows high conscientiousness, solid stress handling, and strong technical competence, with only manageable communication concerns and a minor weakness in numerical memory. Given the current evidence, I continue to recommend Candidate\u202fB, while we should still probe A\u2019s reliability and teamwork before finalizing."}
